<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Brambles bid for Ausdoc fails.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Brambles bid for Ausdoc fails.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport firm Brambles Industries Ltd said its A$2.00 per share bid for document exchange firm Ausdoc Group Ltd ended on Friday after it received acceptances for only 2.18 percent of Ausdoc's issued capital.</p>
<p>The company said the offer had become void and the 1.24 million shares would be returned as the bid did not meet the 90 percent minimum acceptance condition.</p>
<p>Ausdoc shares eased 4.0 cents to A$1.88 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
